@* Imports for the Razor language server (IDE): pages under Ui/ can use the
   components in Ui/Components and Ui/EditorPanels without a per-file @using,
   so they are recognized as components (blue highlighting, IntelliSense, no
   false diagnostics).
   The runtime compiler ignores this file: _-prefixed files are skipped by
   RegisterRazorComponentsFromDirectory and component registration is directory based. *@
@using Crowbar.Editor.Ui.Components
@using Crowbar.Editor.Ui.EditorPanels
